WEBVTT

1
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:20,200
The extraction is successful and you obtain the entry board of the incomplete epic collection.

2
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:21,520
Abyssal Fire Iron Scarf

3
00:00:21,520 --> 00:00:23,920
Can impart genes containing extremely high concentrations of living metals to targets

4
00:00:23,920 --> 00:00:25,280
Assimilation and phagocytosis properties

5
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,800
Is this a collection of incomplete epics?

6
00:00:26,800 --> 00:00:29,280
That's right. After all, he's just a treasure from Baiyin Street.

7
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:31,920
But it's enough to renovate a Silver Street furnace.

8
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:54,030
Architecture is currently the mother school of body-wrapped casting

9
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:56,440
Half-level gold scarf

10
00:00:56,440 --> 00:00:58,040
Can swallow all kinds of metals

11
00:00:58,040 --> 00:01:01,280
Shaped into a high-energy metal block that can be directly swallowed by the industrial and information map

12
00:01:01,280 --> 00:01:03,840
It can also be shaped to have certain self-healing capabilities.

13
00:01:03,840 --> 00:01:05,280
Abyss heavy weapons
